# Playwright Router

Canon: `AGENTS.md` § Tool Routing. Skill: `/playwright`.

## Trigger

Use `/playwright` when task needs browsing, rendered UI verification, browser tests, screenshots, DOM snapshots, navigation, form interaction, or UI-flow debugging.

Skip when task is docs-only, backend-only, or has no rendered/browser surface.

## Rules

- Prefer real browser evidence over static template/CSS guesses.
- Snapshot before acting on element refs; re-snapshot after navigation or large UI changes.
- Capture screenshots/traces when visual proof matters.
- Store artifacts in `output/playwright/`; do not create new top-level artifact folders.
- If browser launch is blocked, report exact error and use the next available verification path.

References: `.cursor/rules/web-interface.mdc`, `documents/ai/manuals/frontend.md`.
